### Create user
POST http://localhost:8888/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "John",
  "last_name": "Doe",
  "email": "johndoe@example.com"
}

### Get users
GET http://localhost:8888/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

### Get user
GET http://localhost:8888/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:8888/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "first_name": "Jane",
    "last_name": "Smith",
    "email": "janesmith@example.com"
}

### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:8888/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
